{"text": "Aille Design aims to destigmatize disability and educate about inclusive representation in the fashion industry.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt15__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The reward includes a t-shirt that features Braille beadwork reading 'fashion is for everyone'.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "product", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt15__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
